---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config';
---

<PageLayout title="Corrections policy" intro="How to tell us about a mistake, and what we do about it.">
  <h2>Reporting an error</h2>
  <p>
    Every article has a <strong>Report an error</strong> link at the bottom. You can also email
    <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}?subject=Correction`}>{SITE.email}</a>. Please tell us which article, what you think is
    wrong, and, if you can, a source for the correct information.
  </p>

  <h2>What we do</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>We acknowledge your message, normally within five working days.</li>
    <li>We check the claim against the original or official source.</li>
    <li>If the article is wrong, we correct it promptly.</li>
    <li>For anything more than a typo, we add a dated correction note at the end of the article saying what changed.</li>
  </ol>

  <h2>What we don't do</h2>
  <p>
    We don't quietly rewrite articles to hide mistakes, and we don't remove articles because a business or advertiser
    would prefer we did. Requests to remove personal information are handled under our
    <a href="/privacy/">privacy notice</a>.
  </p>
</PageLayout>
